Revision history for TPSGI

0.001 2026-10-23 TEODESIAN
    - Initial Release
    - Route by an OpenAPI 3 document: a router exports %openapi in place of
      @routes, and a router that still has @routes dies as it loads.
      Templates take {name} and a final {name+}, the most concrete template
      wins, and parameters are validated and coerced by JSON::Validator.
      A path with a method that it has no route for is a 405, not a 400.
    - Remove static().  nginx serves the renders that save_render() makes.
    - A suffix range, bytes=-N, gets the last N bytes, not a 500, and a
      range whose ends are not whole numbers gets a 416.
    - Remove the indices option, which get_config() never read.  A directory
      is answered by its index.html, index.htm or index.cgi, as before.
    - Run a CGI only from a directory that cgi_dirs names, and none by
      default.  An executable file anywhere else in www/ is served as it is.
